---
title: Goulash
source: Mom
tags: Beef, Soups
---

Brown @ground beef{1%lb} with @onion{1}(small), @salt, and @pepper
to taste in a dutch oven or large skillet.
After the beef is cooked and browned, drain the fat.

Meanwhile, cook @pasta{6%oz}(spirals, wheels, or other shapes)
in a separate pan per package instructions.

Add the cooked noodles and @stewed tomatoes{28%oz} to the beef.
Boil over medium heat to cook through.
Adjust seasonings as needed.
